WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.725
When Institutions Turn on Their Own People — Historical Patterns.

00:00:04.675 --> 00:00:09.437
Every generation discovers that its institutions harmed its own people.

00:00:09.437 --> 00:00:12.400
Every generation says never again.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.675
And every generation watches it happen again because the pattern is always the same.
